    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a96bf8671571419abb5128f155f67694",
      "statement": "TerminalGuard is an RAII guard owning the ratatui Terminal; enter() enables raw mode, enters the alternate screen, enables mouse capture, and builds the terminal, while its Drop implementation restores the terminal unconditionally (including on panic or early return) by disabling raw mode and mouse capture, leaving the alternate screen, and restoring the cursor.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/tui/mod.rs#L26-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:44e997f3149d1d15d263d4b7918ecef12ca9dd2918e33e446bf0af58f84f0239:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4982dda7b7d6422e94f7ac9719a62ae4",
      "statement": "The TUI uses a split-pane layout rendered by ui::draw: a top row with a left menu panel and a right detail panel, and below them a bottom live-preview strip, a one-line status row, and a hint bar; draw refuses to render below 80 columns by 20 rows and stores the panel Rects on the App each frame (via Cell interior mutability) for mouse hit-testing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/tui/ui.rs#L55-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e9ef242b7b25ca16e1126e64010cb830e7d605519e27ced0bc77614ebe4d2401:"
