      "id": "claim_437c1acd2a06407c88df0e110e72ced3",
      "statement": "app.rs deliberately keeps all configurator state and mutating logic free of ratatui draw calls so the helpers can be unit-tested without a terminal; App holds the live config, a saved_config snapshot used by is_dirty(), cursor state, the rebuilt list_rows/selectable_indices/section_starts, the focused panel, a swatch_cache from themes::NAMES, preview samples, transient status, and the mode flags pending_reset/pending_quit/reorder_mode/show_help/should_quit.",
